---
title: Cinnamon buns
id: kanelbullar
description: Classic Swedish buns with cardamom in the dough.
servings: 30 buns
time: 3 hours
tags: [baking, fika, christmas]
kategori: [Pastries]
forfattare: [Mormor Greta]
date: 2026-11-25
---
= Dough
@wheat flour{8%dl}, @sugar{1%dl}, @butter{100%g}(melted), @milk{3%dl}, @yeast{25%g}, @cardamom{1%tsp}(ground)

= Filling
@butter{75%g}(softened), @sugar{0.5%dl}, @cinnamon{1%tbsp}

= Method
Dissolve the @&yeast in lukewarm @&milk and @&butter in a #bowl{}.
Work in the rest of the dough ingredients and let the dough rise for ~{30%minutes}.

Roll out the dough, spread the filling, roll it up and cut into pieces. Let rise for another ~{30%minutes}.

Bake in the #oven{} at 225 °C for ~{8%minutes}.

> Grandma's tip: make a double batch and freeze half.
